\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {End-to-End SPWM Architecture.} Four-stage dataflow: (1) \textit  {Perceptual Bottleneck}: Dual event-camera streams $\mathbf  {E}_t \in \{0, 1\}^{B \times 4 \times 32 \times 32}$ processed via Conv2D + residual fusion ($\mathbf  {F}_t \in \mathbb  {R}^{B \times 16 \times 8 \times 8}$) and SpatialSoftmax ($\tau = 1.0$) extracting topological keypoints $\mathbf  {k}_t \in [-1, 1]^{32}$ and visual embedding $\mathbf  {x}_t \in \mathbb  {R}^{128}$; (2) \textit  {Recurrent Spiking Dynamics}: Predictive coding error $\boldsymbol  {\epsilon }_t = \mathbf  {x}_t - \mathbf  {W}_{\text  {pred}}\mathbf  {z}_{t-1}$ driving a two-tier ALIF core ($N=256$, fast pool $\tau _{\text  {adapt}} \approx 0.47\,\text  {s}$ and slow pool $\tau _{\text  {adapt}} \approx 3.31\,\text  {s}$) with firing-rate homeostasis, producing spikes $\mathbf  {s}_t \in \{0,1\}^{256}$ and membrane states $\mathbf  {m}_t \in \mathbb  {R}^{256}$; (3) \textit  {Phase-Space Partitioning}: Normalization into $\mathbf  {p}_{t+1} \in \mathbb  {R}^{96}$ and direct momentum slicing $\mathbf  {p}_{t+1}[..., :32]$ into $\mathbf  {q}_{t+1} \in \mathbb  {R}^{32}$ regulated by the Anti-Evanescence Stasis Gate $K_{\text  {gate}}$; (4) \textit  {Predictor \& Decoder}: Action-conditioned dissipative surrogate ($M_1$) and zero-lag kinematic decoder feeding Differentiable Forward Kinematics (FK) and Residual-Gated Sensory Handover (Eq.~\ref {eq:handover}).}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{3}{}{figure.1}{}}
